    {
      "bbox": [
        382,
        364,
        1307,
        410
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The City of New York is currently in a fiscal crisis which mandates cur-\ntailment of programs in areas where financial economies may be realized; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
