        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.69
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        361,
        713,
        1284,
        758
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, therefore, by the power vested in me as Mayor of The City of New York, it is hereby ordered as follows:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1923,
          "min": -1.0093
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0026,
          "min": -0.0026
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 26,
          "mean": -0.0098,
          "min": -0.2022
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5570,
        "area_px": 42458,
        "density": 0.13119,
        "chars": 108,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.39
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        406,
        757,
        1284,
        910
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "Section 1. All agencies are to immediately reduce their telephone equipment expenditures, as reflected in the financial plan for fiscal year 1975-1976 as approved by the Emergency Financial Control Board (Code 402), by not less than ten (10) per cent. Each agency shall, within thirty (30) days of the date of this Executive Order, furnish a detailed report to the Office of Management and Budget showing the methods used to accomplish these savings. Such methods shall not include relocations or other alterations that incur charges.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1987,
          "min": -0.9537
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 2,
          "mean": -0.0103,
          "min": -0.0205
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 114,
          "mean": -0.004,
          "min": -0.4381
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 28336,
        "area_px": 135212,
        "density": 0.20957,
        "chars": 534,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.85
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        406,
        915,
        1284,
        1090
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "\u00a7 2. The Municipal Service Administrator is hereby charged with the duty and responsibility of immediately developing plans, procedures, priorities and policies for achieving the proper, efficient and most economical use of the telephone systems in all agencies of The City of New York whose telephone expenditures are chargeable to the Municipal Services Administration budget and shall promulgate rules, regulations and orders for the implementation thereof. The Administrator is further vested with the authority and charged with the duty of enforcing and implementing any such rules, regulations and orders.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1916,
          "min": -1.131
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 2,
          "mean": -0.0018,
          "min": -0.0036
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 101,
          "mean": -0.0006,
          "min": -0.0235
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 32988,
        "area_px": 154528,
        "density": 0.21348,
        "chars": 611,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.52
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        406,
        1095,
        1284,
        1162
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "\u00a7 3. All affected departments and agencies are directed to fully cooperate, assist and immediately implement all policies and orders of the Municipal Services Administrator or his designated representatives, pursuant to this Executive Order.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
