      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "\u00a7 6. The New York Telephone Company has agreed to cooperate in the imple-\nmentation of equipment expenditure reductions and shall coordinate their efforts with\nthe Municipal Services Administrator and the Office of Management and Budget.\nUpon completion of the equipment reduction program, the New York Telephone\nCompany has consented to continue examining the communication network and shall\nmake further recommendations regarding increasing efficiency and economies.",
